pg-turbovec (2.0.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Upgrade to upstream pg_turbovec 2.0.0 and pgrx 0.19.2.
  * Build PostgreSQL 14 through 18 and ship the complete 1.29.x upgrade chain.
  * Drop the obsolete OpenBLAS build and link dependency.
  * Require a backend restart, ALTER EXTENSION, and one REINDEX per
    turbovec index when migrating the on-disk wire format from v7 to v8.

 -- Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 19:00:00 +0800

